def $concat_text(text*)

1. Case analysis on `text*`
  1. Case `text*` matches pattern []
    1. Return ""

  2. Case `text*` matches pattern _ :: _
    1. Let `t_h :: t_t*` be text*
    2. Return t_h ++ `$concat_text(t_t*)`

