  2. Let `constructorTypeIR_subst` be `$subst_constructorType(theta, constructorTypeIR)`
  3. Return (constructorTypeIR_subst, [])
3. Assert that (|tid_tparam*| > 0) /\ (|typeIR_arg*| = 0).
