            2. Let `i_l'` be `$to_int(`w_l` as `int`, i_l)`
            3. Let `i'` be `$to_bitstr(`w_l` as `int`, `$shl(i_l', i_r)`)`
            4. Return `(w_l s i')` as `value`

          3. Case `numberLiteral'` matches pattern `%S%`
