def $cast_sequence'(typeIR'', value*)

1. Case analysis on `typeIR''`
  1. Case `typeIR''` has type `listTypeIR`
    1. Let `(list< typeIR >)` be `typeIR''` as `listTypeIR`
    2. Return `([ `$cast_op(typeIR, value)`* ])` as `value`

