   | ret

;; ../../../../spec-concrete/5.0-flow.watsup:9.1-9.34
def $join_flow(flow'', flow''')

1. Assert that flow'' matches pattern `RET`.
  1. Assert that flow''' matches pattern `RET`.
    1. Return (ret)
2. Otherwise
  1. Return (cont)

