                  7. Let `(_expressionIR # (( typeIR_f ctk_f )))` be typedExpressionIR_f, for each `_expressionIR` in `_expressionIR*` and `ctk_f` in `ctk_f*` and `typeIR_f` in `typeIR_f*` and `typedExpressionIR_f` in `typedExpressionIR_f*`
