                2. Case analysis on `ctk_index matches pattern `LCTK``
                  1. Case true
                    1. Let [`value_index` be the static evaluation of `typedExpressionIR_index_reduced`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC`](Eval_static)
                    2. Let `int` be `$to_number(value_index)`
                    3. Assert that `int` has type `nat`.
                      1. Let `n_index` be `int` as `nat`
                      2. Assert that (n_index < n_size).
