          2. Let [`typedExpressionIR_hi` be the result of typing `expression_hi`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC`](Expr_ok)
          3. Let [`typedExpressionIR_lo` be the result of typing `expression_lo`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC`](Expr_ok)
