                            4. Result in `(`(typedExpressionIR_base [ typedExpressionIR_hi_reduced : typedExpressionIR_lo_reduced ])` as `expressionIR` # expressionNoteIR)`

  10. Case `expression'''` has type `callExpression`
    1. Let `callExpression` be `expression'''` as `callExpression`
    2. Group callExpression-routineTarget: p, TC, `callExpression` as `expression`

      1. Case analysis on `callExpression`
        1. Case `callExpression` matches pattern `%(%)`
