        2. Case `callExpression` matches pattern `%<%>(%)`
          1. Let `(routineTarget < realTypeArgumentList >( argumentList ))` be callExpression
          2. Let [`routineTargetIR` be the result of typing `routineTarget`, under cursor `p` and typing context `TC`](RoutineTarget_ok)
          3. Let `realTypeArgument*` be `$flatten_realTypeArgumentList(realTypeArgumentList)`
