              2. Assert that `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)` has type `(rid, methodTypeIR, id*)`.
                1. Let `(rid', methodTypeIR', id_default*)` be `(rid, routineTypeDefIR, id*)` as `(rid, methodTypeIR, id*)`
                2. Assert that (rid' = rid).
                  1. Assert that (methodTypeIR' = methodTypeIR).
                    1. Result in ``methodTypeIR` as `routineTypeIR``, `[]`, `id_default*`
        2. Group typedExpressionIR-nameIR-control-apply-method: p, TC, (typedExpressionIR_base . "apply"), [], argumentIR*

