;; ../../../../spec-concrete/5.10-typing-statement.watsup:332.1-334.29
relation SwitchCase_general_ok: TC, f, typeIR_switch, b_last, switchCase

1. Case analysis on `switchCase`
  1. Case `switchCase` matches pattern `%:%`
    1. Let `(switchLabel : blockStatement)` be switchCase
    2. Group switchLabel-blockStatement: TC, f, typeIR_switch, b_last, (switchLabel : blockStatement)

