          3. Let [`typedExpressionIR_r` be the result of typing `expression_r`, under cursor `(local)` and typing context `TC`](Expr_ok)
          4. Let `(typedExpressionIR, typedExpressionIR)?` be `$coerce_binary(typedExpressionIR_l, typedExpressionIR_r)`
