  4. Result in `IC_2`, `STO_1`, `(annotationList { blockElementStatementListIR_inst })`

;; ../../../../spec-concrete/7.03-instantiation-relation.watsup:49.1-51.20
relation Bind_method: rdenv_0, methodPrototypeIR

1. Case analysis on `methodPrototypeIR`
  1. Case `methodPrototypeIR` matches pattern `%%;`
    1. Let `(annotationList (typeIR_ret nameIR < typeParameterListIR , typeParameterListIR_inferred >( parameterIR* )) ;)` be methodPrototypeIR
